 "text": "Sandhills Renewable Energy | Ethanol Production Atkinson, NE\n0\nSkip to Content\nAbout\nAbout SRE\nEmployees\nBoard Members\nSafety Data Sheets\nTrading\nTrading Information\nTrading Systems Bulletin\nCash Bids\nCurrent SRE Cash Bids\nSRE Customer Portal\nEmployment\nContact Us\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nAbout\nAbout SRE\nEmployees\nBoard Members\nSafety Data Sheets\nTrading\nTrading Information\nTrading Systems Bulletin\nCash Bids\nCurrent SRE Cash Bids\nSRE Customer Portal\nEmployment\nContact Us\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nFolder:\nAbout\nFolder:\nTrading\nFolder:\nCash Bids\nEmployment\nContact Us\nBack\nAbout SRE\nEmployees\nBoard Members\nSafety Data Sheets\nBack\nTrading Information\nTrading Systems Bulletin\nBack\nCurrent SRE Cash Bids\nSRE Customer Portal\nSandhills\nRenewable Energy\nA leader in finding ways to bring energy to more communities, more people, and in more methods each and every day. Sandhills Renewable Energy means providing our most sustainable renewable resources across the Midwest through our innovative production facility located in the heartland of Atkinson, NE.\nFind Your Way to SRE\nLocation\n87590 Hillcrest Rd.\nAtkinson, NE 68713\nOffice Hours\nMonday - Friday: 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nContact Us: 402-925-5570\nGrain Receiving Hours\nMonday - Friday: 7:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nFor grain bids, please contact Husker Trading:\n402-564-8800\nOur Mission\nSandhills Renewable Energy is a producer of low carbon renewable energy with a hard work, can do philosophy, that is prevalent in the Sandhills region. Leveraging over 60 years of combined operational knowledge between Husker Ag, Lincolnway Energy and the newly formed Sandhills Energy, we are working together to ensure a successful company that perfectly supports the agriculture economy in the area, while also providing a profitable return for our investors and the community.\nBuy or Sell Sandhills Renewable Energy Shares\nView Trading System Bulletin\nDaily Corn Bids\nView Current SRE Bids\nInterested in working for Sandhills Renewable Energy?\nView Job Opportunities\nContact\nAddress: 87590 Hillcrest Rd, Atkinson, NE 68713\nPhone: 402-925-5570\nOffice Hours: M - F 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nConnect\nCOPYRIGHT © 2026 CREATIVE ADVANTAGES",
